1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Fourth Episode
The Assassins

15
00:01:52,781 --> 00:01:55,215
Before we get to
today's story,

16
00:01:55,261 --> 00:01:58,094
let's briefly recall
the previous episodes.

17
00:01:58,141 --> 00:02:01,213
The King disappeared
and it was decided that Sapphire

18
00:02:01,261 --> 00:02:03,491
...would become the new King.

19
00:02:03,661 --> 00:02:06,414
But on the day of the coronation
ceremony,

20
00:02:06,461 --> 00:02:10,579
the Queen was deceived
by the evil Geralamon and Neelon..

21
00:02:10,741 --> 00:02:13,733
...and she revealed that Sapphire
was a girl.

22
00:02:14,541 --> 00:02:19,774
Therefore, Sapphire and the Queen were
locked in the coffin tower.

23
00:02:21,421 --> 00:02:26,734
As a result, Geralamon felt
free to tyrannize the people.

24
00:02:27,541 --> 00:02:30,214
Hearing of this,
Sapphire escaped...

25
00:02:30,261 --> 00:02:32,934
...through the hole
that a little mouse showed her

26
00:02:32,981 --> 00:02:35,097
And in the guise
of the phantom knight,

27
00:02:35,141 --> 00:02:39,817
she defeated Geralamon's retinue
and saved the suffering prisoners.

28
00:02:40,021 --> 00:02:43,013
Meanwhile, Geralamon was preparing
a cruel plan:

29
00:02:43,061 --> 00:02:46,610
suspecting that the phantom
knight could be Sapphire,

30
00:02:46,661 --> 00:02:49,300
he sent skilled assassins
to the tower.

31
00:02:49,461 --> 00:02:53,010
Now, the life of Sapphire
and the Queen is in danger.

32
00:02:53,341 --> 00:02:56,219
Let us now proceed to narrate
today's episode.

33
00:03:15,141 --> 00:03:17,735
This damn mouse!

34
00:03:39,021 --> 00:03:41,330
So, tell me: what is it?

35
00:03:45,021 --> 00:03:48,252
Excuse me, cute little mouse,
but I really don't understand you.

36
00:04:01,021 --> 00:04:03,012
But what is it you want to tell me?

37
00:04:09,261 --> 00:04:12,697
Assassins?! Surely they
have come here to kill me!

38
00:04:13,021 --> 00:04:15,376
Little mouse,
thank you for warning me!

39
00:04:26,341 --> 00:04:29,333
- Mother, assassins are coming!
- What? Assassins?!

40
00:04:29,381 --> 00:04:31,736
Absolutely do not open the door!

41
00:04:40,021 --> 00:04:41,659
What do you want to do?

42
00:04:41,901 --> 00:04:43,892
I want to get rid of the assassins!

43
00:05:02,501 --> 00:05:07,097
Now, Gama, show us where the
room is of Sapphire and the Queen.

44
00:05:07,141 --> 00:05:08,813
Come!

45
00:05:13,861 --> 00:05:15,692
Sapphire...!

46
00:05:20,781 --> 00:05:24,251
- They are in this room.
- Are you really sure they are here?

47
00:05:24,301 --> 00:05:27,737
I locked them securely inside and
le ho mai lasciate uscire da qui,

48
00:05:27,781 --> 00:05:30,215
except to make them work.

49
00:05:30,261 --> 00:05:31,819
All right.

50
00:05:33,181 --> 00:05:36,776
I don't like it very much.
They are just a girl and a woman.

51
00:05:36,821 --> 00:05:40,894
Shut up and listen! After I have
made a hole in this door,

52
00:05:40,941 --> 00:05:44,456
all you have to do is
throw the rocket bomb inside

53
00:05:45,301 --> 00:05:48,611
- Okay!
- If the other three show up

54
00:05:48,781 --> 00:05:52,296
kill them!
Do you understand? Now light it!

55
00:06:00,661 --> 00:06:04,017
- Don't you think that's a bit much?
- Will you cut it out?!

56
00:06:10,101 --> 00:06:12,217
Sapphire, hurry!

57
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:22,010
- The Phantom Knight!
- Hey, assassins!

58
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:25,256
What?! But how did you get in?

59
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,491
I can enter
from anywhere!

60
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:30,772
I will kill anyone who harms
the Queen and Sapphire!

61
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:12,212
And don't you dare ever again
get close to...

62
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:14,491
...the Queen
and Princess Sapphire!

63
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:18,377
It's strange...
That voice and that appearance.

64
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:26,699
It's as if I have
already known him.

65
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,377
Sapphire!

66
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:38,096
It's impossible..!
He looks a lot like her.

67
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:52,452
Yes, I've got it! It's almost impossible,
but he looks a lot like her!

68
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:54,811
Anyway, I must make sure of it.

69
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:24,656
I got scared! It's you, Gama!

70
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:27,258
Gama, it was terrible!

71
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:30,134
Many horrible men
tried to kill us.

72
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:32,536
But a man called
"phantom knight"...

73
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:34,458
..appeared and helped us

74
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:37,618
Listen, Gama, but who the hell is
the phantom knight?

75
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:41,811
So it's not her!
But she looks so much like her!

76
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:45,012
I can't waste time.

77
00:08:45,061 --> 00:08:47,575
It must have been Geralamon
who sent those assassins.

78
00:08:47,621 --> 00:08:51,330
I think he deserves a good lesson
and I'll make sure to give it to him!

79
00:09:00,461 --> 00:09:02,736
The ghost knight!

80
00:09:07,941 --> 00:09:12,537
Open the gate! I have something
to settle with Geralamon!

81
00:09:13,901 --> 00:09:15,812
Open the gate!

82
00:09:15,861 --> 00:09:21,493
Well, I never! Well, I never! Well, I
never! Well, I never! Well, I never!

83
00:09:22,101 --> 00:09:23,739
Well, I never!

84
00:09:26,421 --> 00:09:29,333
It happened that... It happened...
You see, it happened that...

85
00:09:29,381 --> 00:09:31,258
But what the hell happened?

86
00:09:31,301 --> 00:09:33,496
The ghost knight wants to
force his way into the castle!

87
00:09:33,541 --> 00:09:36,180
What?! Idiot, don't let
him in! Drive him away!

88
00:09:36,221 --> 00:09:38,610
Kill him!
Don't let him return alive!

89
00:09:42,381 --> 00:09:45,020
Hey, Geralamon! I'm sending
your assassins back to you..

90
00:09:45,061 --> 00:09:47,211
...that you sent
to the coffin tower!

91
00:09:48,581 --> 00:09:52,779
Kill him!
Kill him immediately!

92
00:09:55,781 --> 00:09:57,817
Grand Duke, what is going on?

93
00:10:01,341 --> 00:10:03,730
Hey, you! Isn't it good?

94
00:10:11,021 --> 00:10:12,659
One more!

95
00:10:17,421 --> 00:10:19,093
Ole!

96
00:10:29,021 --> 00:10:31,740
Listen, Geralamon!
The phantom knight..

97
00:10:31,781 --> 00:10:33,692
...could appear
at any moment!

98
00:10:33,741 --> 00:10:36,130
I will fight against you
until death!

99
00:10:41,141 --> 00:10:44,497
I will soon annihilate you!
Prepare yourself for this! Come on!

100
00:10:45,581 --> 00:10:49,096
- Hurrah! Hurrah!
- Long live the phantom knight!

101
00:11:12,181 --> 00:11:15,810
Hey, you, innkeeper!
Bring more wine, quickly!

102
00:11:15,861 --> 00:11:18,295
Listen, I will bring you
all the wine you want,

103
00:11:18,341 --> 00:11:20,536
but then do you intend
to pay or not?

104
00:11:20,581 --> 00:11:23,254
What? Do you want to force us to pay?

105
00:11:23,301 --> 00:11:25,019
Yes, well... yes..

106
00:11:25,341 --> 00:11:29,812
Damn you, try saying that again!
Do you know who we are or not?

107
00:11:29,861 --> 00:11:32,295
- Help! Help!
- Innkeeper, bring us some wine

108
00:11:32,341 --> 00:11:36,050
or we will have this child devoured
by King Plastic's dogs!

109
00:11:36,701 --> 00:11:39,613
- Oh, forgive me!
- Bring some wine, now!

110
00:11:40,701 --> 00:11:43,579
Damn you!
You will be torn apart by the dogs!

111
00:11:44,181 --> 00:11:46,137
The phantom knight!

112
00:11:46,181 --> 00:11:49,810
Soldiers of Geralamon, the phantom
knight will get you drunk!

113
00:11:49,861 --> 00:11:51,419
Courage!

114
00:11:56,181 --> 00:11:58,900
The phantom knight! How wonderful!

115
00:12:21,221 --> 00:12:24,770
- The phantom knight!
- What happened to those people?

116
00:12:25,341 --> 00:12:28,492
Because they sang
the song of the phantom knight,

117
00:12:28,541 --> 00:12:30,179
they will become slaves!

118
00:12:30,221 --> 00:12:32,018
The song of the phantom knight?

119
00:12:32,061 --> 00:12:34,017
Yes, it's a popular song.
It goes like this:

120
00:12:34,061 --> 00:12:36,450
"The phantom knight
is the champion"!

121
00:12:37,821 --> 00:12:40,335
Wait! Wait!

122
00:12:55,821 --> 00:12:58,096
Hooray! Hooray!

123
00:12:58,141 --> 00:13:06,141
The phantom knight
is the champion!

124
00:13:09,181 --> 00:13:11,376
Did you say he freed
the prisoners?

125
00:13:11,421 --> 00:13:14,493
Yes, he's elusive! You can
never know when he will show up!

126
00:13:15,461 --> 00:13:18,692
The Phantom Knight
is the champion!

127
00:13:18,741 --> 00:13:20,732
- How wonderful!
- Idiot!

128
00:13:22,621 --> 00:13:26,011
Curse that Phantom Knight...!

129
00:13:27,821 --> 00:13:31,131
I've got it! I found a way to
capture the Phantom Knight!

130
00:13:31,821 --> 00:13:34,813
The Phantom Knight
is very popular with children,

131
00:13:34,861 --> 00:13:38,058
so, if we take a child
hostage, he will come to free him!

132
00:13:38,741 --> 00:13:41,619
And we'll set a trap for him
that he will surely fall into!

133
00:13:43,421 --> 00:13:51,421
The ghost knight
is the champion!

134
00:13:57,021 --> 00:14:01,697
The ghost knight
is the champion!

135
00:14:01,741 --> 00:14:04,255
The ghost knight...

136
00:14:05,421 --> 00:14:07,571
Help! Help!

137
00:14:10,861 --> 00:14:13,659
- Taste it, it's a delicious juice.
- Thank you.

138
00:14:13,941 --> 00:14:16,011
Ghost knight!

139
00:14:17,741 --> 00:14:21,051
Cursed ghost knight,
this time you will die!

140
00:14:32,221 --> 00:14:35,293
- Help!
- Mama! Mama!

141
00:14:35,341 --> 00:14:37,571
Help, I'm scared!

142
00:14:38,621 --> 00:14:42,660
Cry! Cry! The ghost
knight will come to help you!

143
00:14:44,061 --> 00:14:47,019
And if he comes, we will win!
If he comes to this square,

144
00:14:47,061 --> 00:14:49,939
the cannon, the rockets and the arrows
will attack him!

145
00:14:50,221 --> 00:14:52,212
He will die in an instant!

146
00:15:06,581 --> 00:15:08,572
But what is he waiting for?

147
00:15:10,181 --> 00:15:13,890
- Mom!
- Help!

148
00:15:14,341 --> 00:15:17,572
What's happening, ghost
knight? Are you scared?

149
00:15:28,621 --> 00:15:30,851
Damned ghost knight!

150
00:15:34,581 --> 00:15:36,458
I wonder if he's scared.

151
00:15:44,021 --> 00:15:47,013
Cry, children! Cry!
And the knight...

152
00:15:51,821 --> 00:15:53,812
Is coming from the sky?!

153
00:16:22,501 --> 00:16:24,492
Who's next!

154
00:16:32,021 --> 00:16:36,458
Water! Throw some water!
But not on me, you idiot!

155
00:16:42,421 --> 00:16:44,139
What?!

156
00:16:45,461 --> 00:16:47,417
I'm dying of rage!

157
00:16:48,741 --> 00:16:51,130
And now go back
all of you home.

158
00:16:52,181 --> 00:16:56,015
- Thank you, ghost knight!
- Be careful!

159
00:16:56,101 --> 00:16:58,092
Don't get kidnapped again!

160
00:17:02,221 --> 00:17:04,257
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

161
00:17:04,301 --> 00:17:06,257
- You are Baron Neelon, aren't you?
- Shut up!

162
00:17:06,301 --> 00:17:09,452
Good heavens! Don't you want
to know where the ghost knight is?

163
00:17:09,501 --> 00:17:11,412
The ghost knight...

164
00:17:12,501 --> 00:17:15,220
What?
Ah, how beautiful you are.

165
00:17:15,261 --> 00:17:17,729
You are looking for the
ghost knight, aren't you?

166
00:17:18,061 --> 00:17:20,894
Yes! I wonder where that
damned knight is, damn it!

167
00:17:20,941 --> 00:17:23,011
- I know!
- What? Really?

168
00:17:23,061 --> 00:17:25,416
Tell me, please! Please,
beautiful lady! Please!

169
00:17:25,461 --> 00:17:28,214
I will tell the Grand Duke
Geralamon! I would be truly glad...

170
00:17:28,261 --> 00:17:31,651
...to see that clean-shaven
face of Grand Duke Geralamon.

171
00:17:32,221 --> 00:17:34,496
Yes, but don't you prefer to see mine?

172
00:17:34,941 --> 00:17:38,013
No! I prefer the clean-shaven
one of Geralamon!

173
00:17:38,221 --> 00:17:42,100
I see... Then I will take
you to the castle, alright.

174
00:17:58,461 --> 00:18:00,895
Here, please have the
courtesy to wait here, please!

175
00:18:00,941 --> 00:18:03,091
Soon Grand Duke
Geralamon will arrive.

176
00:18:03,141 --> 00:18:05,018
Yes, of course, I'll wait!

177
00:18:05,061 --> 00:18:07,575
How beautiful and kind you are,
damn it!

178
00:18:07,901 --> 00:18:10,415
Well, then wait here
just a moment.

179
00:18:19,101 --> 00:18:22,935
Is that the lady who knows
where the ghost knight is?

180
00:18:23,501 --> 00:18:25,298
Yes, sir.

181
00:18:25,661 --> 00:18:28,129
Then tell me:
where is the ghost knight?

182
00:18:28,181 --> 00:18:30,012
Where is he? Where is the phantom knight?

183
00:18:30,061 --> 00:18:33,178
I want to see him because he is very
handsome! I want to see him because he is...

184
00:18:33,701 --> 00:18:37,171
So, where is the phantom
knight? Answer me!

185
00:18:37,221 --> 00:18:39,098
And show me your face!

186
00:18:41,021 --> 00:18:43,489
He's here!
The phantom knight is here!

187
00:18:43,541 --> 00:18:45,816
- How handsome he is!
- The phantom knight!

188
00:18:49,221 --> 00:18:52,850
- Quick, someone catch him!
- Don't move!

189
00:18:53,821 --> 00:18:56,289
I promised you that I
would appear in the castle!

190
00:18:56,341 --> 00:18:58,650
I kept my promise!
Here I am!

191
00:18:58,781 --> 00:19:00,453
Don't move!

192
00:19:00,701 --> 00:19:02,419
I'll take this!

193
00:19:03,101 --> 00:19:05,137
Catch him!

194
00:19:28,741 --> 00:19:31,813
Catch him!
Take back the crown!

195
00:19:32,181 --> 00:19:34,695
This stupid, foolish, imbecile!

196
00:19:34,741 --> 00:19:37,733
You brought the phantom
knight right into my house!

197
00:19:37,781 --> 00:19:39,817
I am furious!

198
00:19:57,021 --> 00:19:59,899
Sapphire, you are running
very late today.

199
00:20:02,821 --> 00:20:04,539
Gama is coming!

200
00:20:07,421 --> 00:20:10,697
- Hey, open up!
- Please, wait!

201
00:20:10,741 --> 00:20:15,257
Wait?! It's time for Sapphire to
go get the water! Understood?

202
00:20:15,461 --> 00:20:17,816
Wait a moment, please!
Wait!

203
00:20:17,861 --> 00:20:20,136
I can't wait!

204
00:20:23,301 --> 00:20:28,136
She's not here! In fact, I thought
the phantom knight was Sapphire!

205
00:20:28,181 --> 00:20:31,059
- That's not true!
- Yes, exactly!

206
00:20:31,181 --> 00:20:35,811
Listen, do you know what will happen to you
if Sapphire escapes from the castle?

207
00:20:35,861 --> 00:20:38,329
What happens is that you will be hanged!

208
00:20:38,741 --> 00:20:42,177
I warned you!
And now prepare yourself for this!

209
00:20:44,701 --> 00:20:47,090
No! I...

210
00:20:47,501 --> 00:20:50,413
I am sure that Sapphire
went to fetch water.

211
00:20:50,461 --> 00:20:53,373
Don't lie!
Fine, I will go see!

212
00:20:54,421 --> 00:20:57,493
But if she isn't there,
you will be hanged!

213
00:21:02,901 --> 00:21:05,574
Sapphire,
we are finally at the end!

214
00:21:19,781 --> 00:21:23,251
Soon we will see the sun...

215
00:21:24,301 --> 00:21:27,259
Hey! Where have you been?

216
00:21:28,861 --> 00:21:31,739
Since Gama forgot
to close the door,

217
00:21:31,781 --> 00:21:34,295
I went out onto the skylight
to play with the mice.

218
00:21:34,341 --> 00:21:37,333
But I started fetching
water at the right time.

219
00:21:37,381 --> 00:21:40,612
Shut up! You can't do
whatever you want!

220
00:21:42,501 --> 00:21:45,698
Don't laugh!
Yet there is something strange.

221
00:21:45,741 --> 00:21:47,652
I feel as if I've been tricked

222
00:22:05,861 --> 00:22:07,817
Damn phantom knight!

223
00:22:07,861 --> 00:22:11,900
How clever! Brave!
Wonderful! Damn it!

224
00:22:11,941 --> 00:22:14,216
Can't I even kill
a single girl?

225
00:22:14,261 --> 00:22:16,570
Even the assassins
were sent back!

226
00:22:16,621 --> 00:22:19,897
And that knight was not
caught in our trap!

227
00:22:23,101 --> 00:22:25,615
Now I've got it!
I've got an idea!

228
00:22:25,661 --> 00:22:29,495
I'm fed up with your stupid ideas!
Don't bother me!

229
00:22:29,541 --> 00:22:32,180
No, no! But this one is really good!
This is the best!

230
00:22:32,221 --> 00:22:34,212
Fortunately,
there's a storm outside!

231
00:22:34,261 --> 00:22:36,331
I can't miss
this opportunity!

232
00:22:36,581 --> 00:22:39,254
You'd better tell Gama
to kill them in secret,

233
00:22:39,301 --> 00:22:41,337
rather than sending assassins.

234
00:23:02,541 --> 00:23:05,214
"Gama, today is the day
most favorable.

235
00:23:05,341 --> 00:23:08,458
Kill the Queen and Sapphire
tonight.

236
00:23:08,501 --> 00:23:12,335
You will receive the reward
from my emissary. Baron Neelon".

237
00:23:17,541 --> 00:23:20,009
And try to do it well!

238
00:23:36,221 --> 00:23:39,850
Honestly, it wouldn't be my
intention to kill a girl,

239
00:23:40,341 --> 00:23:42,901
but I can't help it

240
00:23:50,821 --> 00:23:52,812
